  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New: TemporalIntervalTree.GetOverlapping, CountOverlapping and RemoveEndedBefore make overlap/End-based semantics explicit. Performance improvements: binary-search-based range queries in TemporalDictionary; TryDequeue/TryPeek added to TemporalQueue. Bug fixes: TemporalIntervalTree no longer drops or mis-removes distinct values with colliding hash codes; TemporalCircularBuffer.Add, TemporalQueue.Enqueue, TemporalDictionary.Add and TemporalMultimap.AddValue now guarantee chronological order under concurrent writers; TemporalSegmentedArray no longer throws when adding after TrimExcess; TemporalDictionary pruning no longer removes a key re-created concurrently; TemporalPriorityQueue no longer throws on null priorities.",
